      "options": {
        "code": {"language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false},
        "content": "### Supported\n\n- Stream selectors, **equality only**:\n  `{service=\"api\", level=\"error\"}`\n- Line filters: `|=` `!=` `|~` `!~`\n- `| drop <labels>` as the last stage\n  (Grafana appends `| drop __error__`)\n- Metric queries: count_over_time, rate,\n  bytes_over_time, bytes_rate, wrapped in\n  sum / sum by (...) / sum without (...)\n- Endpoints: `query`, `query_range`, `labels`,\n  `label/{name}/values`\n\n### Not supported — returns an explicit 400\n\n- unwrap and the other _over_time functions\n  (avg_over_time, quantile_over_time, ...)\n- Binary operations: sum(...) / sum(...)\n- Other pipelines: `| json`, `| logfmt`,\n  `line_format`, `| unwrap`\n- Regex/negative **label** matchers: `=~` `!=` `!~`\n  (so the variables above are single-select)\n\n### Not implemented — returns 404\n\n- Live tail (`/loki/api/v1/tail`, needs WebSocket)\n- Query size estimate (`/loki/api/v1/index/stats`)\n\nWalkthrough: `docs/runbooks/grafana-logs-demo.md`",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
